Package: localmap
Title: Settings-First Tasmanian Field-Site Mapping
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Barry", family = "Brook", role = c("aut","cre"), email = "barry.brook@utas.edu.au"))
Description: Builds reproducible maps, site-attribute tables, and provenance
    records for configured Tasmanian field sites. A settings-first interface
    resolves project inputs and spatial layers into a 'targets' workflow with
    explicit offline and live-data behaviour.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
